# Skills installed with `npx skills add`.
#
# skills-lock.json is committed — it pins the source and a sha256 of each
# skill, so `npx skills add` restores exactly what everyone else has.
#
# The two directories it materialises are not. .agents holds the fetched
# SKILL.md, which the lockfile can fetch again; .claude/skills holds a
# symlink into it written with an ABSOLUTE path, so it is broken on every
# machine but this one.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
